# Loop 400 Review — Agent 1/10 Pass 1 (layout/responsive)

Branch: feature/loop-400-review (from feature/loop-200-review)

## Loop 1
- **Review:** layout.css sticky sidebar overrides bloomberg `position:fixed` on mobile — off-canvas nav may reserve block flow space.
- **Fix:** `@media (max-width:768px)` — `.app-layout .sidebar/.sb { position:fixed; z-index:101 }`.

## Loop 2
- **Review:** bloomberg `.app-main { margin-left:240px }` still active alongside grid shell — risk of double gutter.
- **Fix:** `.app-layout .app-main { margin-left:0 !important; max-width:none !important }`.

## Loop 3
- **Review:** Mobile hamburger `top:16px` overlaps 32px ticker tape — menu icon hidden/clashing.
- **Fix:** ui-enhance 768px — hamburger `top: calc(var(--ticker-tape-height) + 8px)`.

## Loop 4
- **Review:** Toast `top:16px` (base inline) overlaps ticker on phone.
- **Fix:** ui-enhance `#toast-container` offset below ticker; max-width avoids hamburger.

## Loop 5
- **Review:** Hero input flex-row on 375px — analyze button squeezed, sub-44px tap target.
- **Fix:** layout.css 600px — `.hero-input { flex-direction:column }`, full-width 44px controls.

## Loop 6
- **Review:** `.hero-chips` no flex-wrap — HK/BTC chips clip off-screen on narrow phones.
- **Fix:** `flex-wrap: wrap` on `.hero-chips`.

## Loop 7
- **Review:** bloomberg mobile `padding-top:60px` dead code — ui-enhance ticker padding uses `!important`.
- **Fix:** Removed redundant mobile padding-top/16px shorthand from bloomberg 768 block.

## Loop 8
- **Review:** Bottom nav ignores iPhone home-indicator — last tab clipped.
- **Fix:** `padding-bottom: calc(8px + env(safe-area-inset-bottom))` on bottom-nav + app-main.

## Loop 9
- **Review:** Portfolio summary 2-col at 480px — cards too narrow to read.
- **Fix:** ui-enhance 480px — `.portfolio-summary { grid-template-columns:1fr }`.

## Loop 10
- **Review:** Onboard banner close button ~20px tap target on mobile.
- **Fix:** bloomberg 480px — close button min 44×44px flex center.

## Loop 11
- **Review:** Scanner results header `flex justify-between` overflows on 320px.
- **Fix:** ui-enhance `#scanner-results > .flex` column stack at 768px.

## Loop 12
- **Review:** Index status-bar 4 items overflow without wrap at 768px (ui-enhance had no rule).
- **Fix:** ui-enhance 768px `.status-bar { flex-wrap:wrap; gap:12px }`.

## Loop 13
- **Review:** Ticker pause button 2×6px padding — hard to tap.
- **Fix:** `min-width/height: 28px` on `.ticker-tape-pause` (fits 32px bar).

## Loop 14
- **Review:** Hero title 2rem on 320px — wraps awkwardly beside hidden owl.
- **Fix:** layout.css 480px `.hero-title { font-size:1.35rem }`.

